# The coop undone and redone while the hens walk home at nightfall (Q3-02): none stays out at
# night, and tomorrow's flock is the coop's, never one on top of a lingering hen.
set unlock all
set season summer
set time 0.3
place coop @26,30 0
set camera 27 31 2
fast 30
set time 0.62
fast 2
set time 0.626
fast 1.4
key ctrl+z
wait 2
key ctrl+shift+z
wait 2
expect count coop 1
fast 160
set time 0.75
fast 60
expect visible hen 0
expect population yes
set time 0.30
fast 90
expect population yes
quit
